OL,3,CHouseholds without water after burst
OL,4,Cmain
OL,6,FPeople living in the BS30 area of
OL,7,FBristol have been left with no water
OL,8,For low water pressure due to a burst
OL,9,Fmain.
OL,11,FThe issue was first reported at around
OL,12,F6pm on Wednesday 29 September.
OL,14,FAt the time, Bristol Water said: "Due
OL,15,Fto an issue in the BS30 area, you may
OL,16,Fexperience no water or very poor
OL,17,Fpressure.
OL,19,F"Our District Inspector is on route to
OL,20,Finvestigate this."We will endeavour to
OL,21,Frestore your water as soon as possible.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/2
