OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1785410317
OL,3,CHouseholds without water after burst
OL,4,Cmain
OL,6,F"Thank you very much for your
OL,7,Fpatience."
OL,9,FEngineers have been working overnight
OL,10,Fto carry out repairs.
OL,12,FThe A420 London Road is closed in both
OL,13,Fdirections from A4175 Bath Road to
OL,14,FChesley Hill to support the repair
OL,15,Fprocess.
